de l'information cl\u00e9 dans des documents \u00e9crits sur des sujets communicatifs de ce niveau. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Les verbes li\u00e9s \u00e0 la cuisine", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<ul><li> Pour parler de recettes, on doit employer quelques verbes li\u00e9s \u00e0 la cuisine. Le tableau ci-dessous montre quelques verbes que vous pouvez employer lorsque vous parlez des recettes et de la cuisine&nbsp;:</li></ul>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":14,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1. Couper en d\u00e9s, en tranches, en b\u00e2tonnets : Sectionner \u00e0 l'aide d'un couteau\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2. Trancher : Couper\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3. \u00c9plucher  : Enlever la peau\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"4. Mijoter ; laisser mijoter : Faire cuire un aliment longtemps \u00e0 petit feu\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"5. Remuer : Agiter un liquide\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"6. R\u00f4tir : Cuire \u00e0 feu vif\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"7. Battre : Frapper\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"8. Frire : Cuire dans l'huile bouillante\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"9. Dorer : Recouvrir ou badigeonner d'\u0153uf battu la surface d'une p\u00e2te\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"10. Verser : Faire couler\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"11. Ajouter ; rajouter : Mettre en plus ; additionner\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"12. Assaisonner : Accommoder un mets \u00e0 l'aide de condiments (le sel, le poivre, la moutarde, etc.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"13. Saupoudrer : Couvrir l\u00e9g\u00e8rement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"14. Go\u00fbter : Tester le go\u00fbt\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span><ul><li>On emploie ces verbes \u00e0 l'imp\u00e9ratif quand on explique une recette. Lisez la recette ci-dessous de la soupe \u00e0 la tomate. Faites surtout attention aux verbes \u00e0 l'imp\u00e9ratif&nbsp;: </li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1. Pelez et \u00e9mincez l'oignon.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2. Faites-le revenir quelques minutes \u00e0 la po\u00eale.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3. Lavez les carottes et coupez-les en morceaux.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"4. Dans une casserole, faites bouillir 1 litre d'eau.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"5. Ajoutez les carottes.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"6. Salez et poivrez.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"7. Apr\u00e8s l'\u00e9bullition, comptez 15 minutes de cuisson.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"8. Ajoutez l'oignon et remuez bien.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"9. Servez avec une tranche de baguette.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le lait de coco", "type": "name"}, {"content": "le lait de noix de coco", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : On sert un dessert avec du lait de coco.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous pouvez employer au supermarch\u00e9.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le bas", "type": "name"}, {"content": "la partie inf\u00e9rieure de quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Regardez en bas de la page, s'il vous pla\u00eet&nbsp;!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le rayon ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un ensemble de comptoirs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : O\u00f9 se trouve le rayon l\u00e9gumes, s'il vous pla\u00eet&nbsp;?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "l'ail", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un condiment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'ajoute de l'ail dans la soupe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le riz", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une c\u00e9r\u00e9ale", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re le riz brun au riz blanc.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "l'\u00e9pice", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un aromate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'aime la soupe avec beaucoup d'\u00e9pices.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le sac", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un contenant souple ; un sachet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je mets tous mes livres dans mon gros sac.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "suffire", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u00eatre assez", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Une bo\u00eete de thon nous suffit.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quel est le nom de la recette traditionnelle de votre famille ?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez les ingr\u00e9dients.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez les \u00e9tapes de la pr\u00e9paration.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Partagez la recette avec votre camarade.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "J'\u00e9cris le nom de la recette.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9cris les ingr\u00e9dients qu'il faut pour pr\u00e9parer la recette.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9cris les \u00e9tapes de la pr\u00e9paration.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je pr\u00e9sente \u00e0 l'oral ma recette \u00e0 mon camarade.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn2le04ob08re2img03.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn2le04ob08re2img03.jpg", "time": "75", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Le vendeur  </span>: Puis-je vous aider, mademoiselle ?<br />"}, {"image": "frn2le04ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "1500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Coraline </span>: Oui, merci monsieur. J'ai une recette \u00e0 pr\u00e9parer et on est un peu press\u00e9s. Pourriez-vous m'indiquer o\u00f9 se trouve le lait de coco ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Le vendeur </span>:  Bien s\u00fbr. Le lait de coco est juste par ici. Regardez en bas \u00e0 gauche !"}, {"image": "frn2le04ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "15000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Coraline </span>: Super ! J'en prends deux bo\u00eetes. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre </span>: O\u00f9 se trouve le rayon l\u00e9gumes ? On a besoin des pommes de terre, de l'ail et des \u00e9pices.<br />"}, {"image": "frn2le04ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "23500", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Le vendeur </span>:  \tTous les l\u00e9gumes sont au rayon 4. Les \u00e9pices sont \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la sortie \u00e0 droite. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline </span>:  \tJe voudrais aussi acheter du riz."}, {"image": "frn2le04ob08re2img02.jpg", "time": "30500", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Le vendeur </span>: Le riz est au fond du magasin. Il y a des sacs de 5 kilos et de 10 kilos. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre </span>:  \tCombien co\u00fbte un sac de 5 kilos ?"}, {"image": "frn2le04ob08re2img02.jpg", "time": "38000", "id": 6, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Le vendeur </span>:   \t6,50 \u20ac. Je reviens, je vous en apporte un. Un sac de 5 kilos vous suffit ? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline </span>: Oui monsieur, tout \u00e0 fait. Merci de nous aider. <br />"}], "audiosrc": "frn2le04ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le04ob08re2img03.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn1le04ob08re3img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn1le04ob08re3img02.jpg", "time": "400", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> La recette de cuisine.  <span>"}, {"image": "frn1le04ob08re3img03.jpg", "time": "11000", "id": 2, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn1le04ob08re3img04.jpg", "time": "24000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> Quels sont les ingr\u00e9dients ?<span>"}, {"image": "frn1le04ob08re3img05.jpg", "time": "45000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> Comment expliquer une recette ?<span>"}, {"image": "frn1le04ob08re3img06.jpg", "time": "50000", "id": 5, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn1le04ob08re3img07.jpg", "time": "56000", "id": 6, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn1le04ob08re3img08.jpg", "time": "62000", "id": 7, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn1le04ob08re3img09.jpg", "time": "74000", "id": 8, "text": ""}], "audiosrc": "frn2le04ob08re3aud01", "coverimg": "frn1le04ob08re3img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Je peux demander des choses au vendeur dans un supermarch\u00e9.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux \u00e9crire une recette.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler des ingr\u00e9dients.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Quelle est votre recette pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e&nbsp;? Quelles sont les \u00e9tapes de pr\u00e9paration&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quel mode de temps employez-vous lorsque vous expliquez la recette&nbsp;? Pourquoi&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade : ", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Coin r\u00e9daction : Coraline et Pierre organisent le d\u00eener. Que pr\u00e9parent-ils ?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id